{"title":"바느질하는 소녀 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bJQVz0/dJMcabilIBy/FVIoeEgGWTsDKljYnHuhPK&filename=th3","synopsis":"「가호 바느질」-----\n그것은 작은 소녀에게 깃든 거대한 힘.\n\n전생의 기억을 간직한 채 기술귀족 뉘르 가문의 장녀로 환생한 유이는, \n의복에 마력을 불어넣는 뉘르 가문 특유의 ‘가호 바느질’을 못하는 것으로 판명되어, \n친부모에게 학대받으며 지옥 같은 나날을 보내고 있었다. \n그런 때 마음씨 고운 귀족에게 바느질 솜씨를 인정받아 그 집에 ‘침모’로 가게 된다.\n감사의 마음을 전하기 위해 자신의 집에서는 숨기고 있던 ‘가호 바느질’ 능력을 사용해 선물을 만든 유이는 \n그 일로 인해 인생에 큰 변화를 맞이한다.\n\nHARIKO NO OTOME\nⓒZeroki 2020 ⓒYuni Yukimura 2020 ⓒMiho Takeoka 2020\nKADOKAWA CORPORATION","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":144,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":210,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":252,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":246,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":228,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":220,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":185,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":186,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":272,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":278,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":293,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}}]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":1462,"rc":8,"rs":62,"cc":11},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":1462,"rc":8,"rs":62,"cc":11},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":1463,"rc":8,"rs"